From: JohnnyC96 <54557697+JohnnyC96@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:18:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 56/58] IOP: optional external SPU2 device (register accesses,
 SPU2 DMA, device-timed DMA ends and SPU2 interrupt); runtime:
 PS2X_SPU2=pcsx2|off from the external library, played through a raylib float
 audio stream

